<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  2.55%			 C/S =  3.18%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.55%			 O/N =  3.39%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.55%			 T/N =  2.55%</p>
<p>		   Jan  13, 1997			Jan 10, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.77%	1 month forward =  6.45%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.96%	2 month forward =  7.47%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.92%	3 month forward =  8.26%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.15%	4 month forward =  8.23%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.07%	5 month forward =  8.22%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.03%	6 month forward =  8.15%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
